{"title":"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 7","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Diagram:\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Diagram:</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Which of these describes the graph of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/b/3db0fe4e5601f81191792b0657fa475e578139f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2(x+y+1)=y^2(x+y+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"232\" height=\"19\" />&#160;?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/d/43d5ff421bb5a861b82fd4f74a81f91c75e9f717.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ \\text{two parallel lines}\\\\ \\text{(B)}\\ \\text{two intersecting lines}\\\\ \\text{(C)}\\ \\text{three lines that all pass through a common point}\\\\ \\text{(D)}\\ \\text{three lines that do not all pass through a common point}\\\\ \\text{(E)}\\ \\text{a line and a parabola}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"1052\" height=\"98\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/d/b/3db0fe4e5601f81191792b0657fa475e578139f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2(x+y+1)=y^2(x+y+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"232\" height=\"19\" /> tells us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b0a0855de5852bc700ca7019c0acb8ef802f76e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37cf301fccde205c03900cbe252706900f389908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" /> . <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b0a0855de5852bc700ca7019c0acb8ef802f76e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" /> generates two lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741a74d86df899c10724dc2f80638f5e7f599194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f08809818fd50ee3fc13182a3112bc2bd28dccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"11\" /> . <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37cf301fccde205c03900cbe252706900f389908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" /> is another straight line. The only intersection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741a74d86df899c10724dc2f80638f5e7f599194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f08809818fd50ee3fc13182a3112bc2bd28dccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"11\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/6/f9603ca3089464e548fc6f1366bc474e7efef8d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" /> , which is not on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37cf301fccde205c03900cbe252706900f389908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" /> . Therefore, the graph is three lines that do not have a common intersection, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/5/5a575fdd96afeecf3eb879682a7631c3e3b54647.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\; \\text{three lines that do not all pass through a common point}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"455\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/c/57c19728b3bea9e7150e49308ef156354c3ca3d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+1\\neq0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"106\" height=\"17\" />, then dividing both sides of the equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/8/e9838a1225fd687a07f61b9a10323935f80d7c35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/0/9b0a0855de5852bc700ca7019c0acb8ef802f76e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"57\" height=\"18\" />. Rearranging and factoring, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/a/ada7569ce67015059a82ab5614b7e090db27afb9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-y^2=(x+y)(x-y)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"229\" height=\"21\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37cf301fccde205c03900cbe252706900f389908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />, then the equation is satisfied. Thus either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/1/c51b625d9c281c479f6fe888c3c485ab22f50aea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cecad80cb6ce8f3ac0c0eca745fc3dce7cca9afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37cf301fccde205c03900cbe252706900f389908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />. These equations can be rearranged into the lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/0/7f08809818fd50ee3fc13182a3112bc2bd28dccb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"58\" height=\"11\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741a74d86df899c10724dc2f80638f5e7f599194.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/a/ffa1aa9dfd04bd921d4c5e1befde25c6e9191cad.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=-x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" />, respectively. Since these three lines are distinct, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/5/5a575fdd96afeecf3eb879682a7631c3e3b54647.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\; \\text{three lines that do not all pass through a common point}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"455\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Subtract <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/6/c164ba37037f40278225156f39054e10b9a8aeae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2(x+y+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"103\" height=\"19\" /> on both sides of the equation to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/4/7140504f7ef6cb072520045428d81a04a527758b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2(x+y+1)-y^2(x+y+1)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"265\" height=\"19\" />. Factoring <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/8/e9838a1225fd687a07f61b9a10323935f80d7c35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/4/fb4f1b418b910ffa3d83a48fce079d876f38f1d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+y+1)(x^2-y^2)=(x+y+1)(x+y)(x-y)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"416\" height=\"19\" />, so either <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/c/37cf301fccde205c03900cbe252706900f389908.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/1/c51b625d9c281c479f6fe888c3c485ab22f50aea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/e/c/cecad80cb6ce8f3ac0c0eca745fc3dce7cca9afa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-y=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"16\" />. Continue on with the second half of solution 2.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Diagram:\">Diagram:</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Diagram:\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/9/5c931fba6b27feaf52b7b4b40002ed6e642db760.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB: y=x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"87\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/4/5a4fd097b539271b2bfa391d35a9a31a1ab35489.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CD: y=-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/0/4d06b8179a0f5342492fc92fe9cbbe2ad38d346f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EF: x+y+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"150\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/0/fc0850af4255be8cfb153e0deaab4b94c31222e5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] size(7cm); pair F= (5,0), E=(-1,6), D=(0,0), C=(6,0), B=(6,6), A=(0,6); draw(A--C); draw(B--D); draw(E--F);  label(&quot;$A$&quot;, A, dir(135)); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, C, dir(-45)); label(&quot;$C$&quot;, B, dir(45)); label(&quot;$D$&quot;, D, dir(-135)); label(&quot;$E$&quot;, E, dir(135)); label(&quot;$F$&quot;, F, dir(-45)); [/asy]\" width=\"332\" height=\"288\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A\">2016 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_13\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_14\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_20\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_21\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2016 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017141555\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.072 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 288/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2294/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 154/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 7365/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.034      1 -total\n 56.82%    7.974      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 41.46%    5.818      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:14564:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017141555 and revision id 288728. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}